  "summary": "I'm a software engineer with years of experience in Frontend and Backend development, specializing in technologies like JS, React, React Native, Node, Python, and many more. I have taken on countless freelance projects, including web and mobile app development, to create high-quality, clean, and efficient websites and applications that not only look great but are built with performance in mind.\n\nMy main focus is creating an intuitive user experience that delights users as soon as they land on the page or open the mobile app. As an experienced software engineer, I understand the importance of staying up-to-date with the latest trends, technologies, and industry best practices to ensure that all projects meet a high standard of quality. Additionally, I pride myself on my ability to take complex problems and come up with creative solutions to deliver successful results consistently.\n\nIn addition to this, I understand the importance of customer satisfaction when it comes to developing successful applications for clients; something which I believe is key when providing services at a competitive rate. As such, my goal is to create interactive user interfaces for both web and React Native mobile applications that not only look visually appealing but are also functional so that customers can get the most out of their applications. Furthermore, I also take great care in ensuring that all of my code is written in an efficient manner so that applications run without any issues on a variety of devices and platforms.",
